      "chatGptNotes": "Content and umlaut checks approved from accepted review ledger chemie-batch-012.md (accepted_pilot). Review note: Accepted. The image highlights only `Li`, `Na`, and `K` in group 1, shows the intended property cards (`weich`, `silbrig glänzend`, `sehr reaktiv`, `bilden M+ Ionen`), and gives typical examples `NaCl`, `KCl`, and lithium-ion battery use. It includes safe storage under oil and does not add reaction equations or unsafe handling.",
