      "chatGptNotes": "Content and umlaut checks approved from accepted review ledger chemie-batch-011.md (accepted_pilot). Review note: Accepted. The image shows `N_A = 6,022 · 10^23 mol^-1`, `N = n · N_A`, and `n = N / N_A`; the example cards keep the proportional particle-count relation as `0,5 · N_A`, `N_A`, and `2 · N_A` without introducing mass or volume.",
