      "chatGptReviewer": "codex-gpt-5.6",
      "chatGptNotes": "Frische Prüfung in Originalauflösung am 2026-07-16: Chemie, Formeln, Stöchiometrie, Ladungen, Apparaturen, Einheiten, sichtbare Beschriftungen und Orthografie geprüft; der exakte importierte Kandidat aus chemie-batch-017.md wurde akzeptiert.",
      "humanReviewedAt": null,
      "humanReviewer": "",
      "aiApproved": "yes",
      "aiApprovedAssetSha256": "sha256:e139513bd8ebf2ed39998039215f0f4065786fa3a88480164916c50c801412c7",
      "aiReviewedAt": "2026-10-12T23:12:41.728301+00:00",
      "aiReviewer": "Codex fresh independent B /root/bio_0beb_underside_single_fresh_independent_b",
      "aiNotes": "Actual bead chains clearly distinguish homopolymer only A, irregular mixed A/B sequence, A-block plus B-block, and A-backbone with B side branches. Actual statistical and block illustrations each visibly show four A and four B beads, without any explicit misleading exact degree/count caption; graft topology shows side chains rather than a mixture of unlinked homopolymers. The two Eigenschaften prüfen prompts and Kombination möglich bound the property illustration to potential combinations. Improved-performance language is illustrative potential for a suitable application, not universal dominance; the whole cases explicitly require trade-offs and testing. At360/316 the four topology drawings, single versus two colors, blocks and graft branches are discernible. Major Nur A/Gemischt/A-Block+B-Block/A-Kette,B-Äste concepts survive; some longer secondary captions need680. Desktop680 makes testing/possible-combination conditions clear."
    },
