      "chatGptReviewer": "",
      "chatGptNotes": "Inactive B010 author metadata binding to exact revised description; pixels KEEP from frozen source-author image inspection. This author binding is not an independent new V judgment or human approval. Inactive B010 author metadata binding to exact revised description; pixels KEEP from frozen source-author image inspection. This author binding is not an independent new V judgment or human approval.",
      "humanReviewedAt": null,
