      "chatGptNotes": "Content and umlaut checks approved from accepted review ledger chemie-batch-007.md (accepted_pilot). Review note: Accepted. The energy axis points upward, the reaction path is exothermic with products below reactants and `Delta E < 0`, and both catalyzed and uncatalyzed paths start and end at the same levels. The catalyzed activation barrier is visibly lower.",
