      "chatGptNotes": "Content and umlaut checks approved from accepted review ledger chemie-batch-012.md (accepted_pilot). Review note: Accepted. The image shows the halogens as diatomic `F2`, `Cl2`, `Br2`, and `I2`, marks reactivity and halogenide formation, and uses everyday examples for fluoride, chlorine compounds, and iodine without presenting elemental chlorine gas as a household cleaner. Inactive B010 author metadata binding to exact revised description; pixels KEEP from frozen source-author image inspection. This author binding is not an independent new V judgment or human approval. Inactive B010 author metadata binding to exact revised description; pixels KEEP from frozen source-author image inspection. This author binding is not an independent new V judgment or human approval.",
