      "chatGptNotes": "Content and umlaut checks approved from accepted review ledger chemie-batch-002.md (accepted_pilot). Review note: Accepted. The gas observations are assigned correctly: oxygen relights a glowing splint, carbon dioxide makes limewater cloudy, and hydrogen gives a small `Plopp` test behind a safety screen. No panel assigns a gas to the wrong detection reaction.",
