      "chatGptNotes": "Content and umlaut checks approved from accepted review ledger chemie-batch-010.md (accepted_pilot). Review note: Accepted. The image treats mol as a counting unit, uses `n = N / N_A`, identifies `N` as particle count and `N_A` as Avogadro constant, and shows `1 mol = 6,022 · 10^23 Teilchen`. It does not equate mol with grams.",
      "humanReviewedAt": null,
