      "chatGptNotes": "Content and umlaut checks approved from accepted review ledger chemie-batch-007.md (accepted_pilot). Review note: Accepted. The equation `H2 + Cl2 -> 2 HCl` is balanced. The coefficient row `1,1,2`, given row `2 mol, 2 mol, ?`, calculated row `2 mol, 2 mol, 4 mol`, and molecule row with two `H2` plus two `Cl2` giving four `HCl` are mutually consistent.",
      "humanReviewedAt": null,
      "humanReviewer": "",
      "aiApproved": "yes",
      "aiApprovedAssetSha256": "sha256:6f633fde5ddf96c717c852816839edb73c62617bedc43d1060c71cd07ae7611a",
